	(text "DC-LINK CAPACITOR CARRIER (D021/D024)\n5x MKP1848C71010JY5 = 500 uF / 1000 V DC bank; 114 A rms / 120 s repetitive ripple duty (SPEC 3.4, 6.1) [TBV vs Vishay thermal model].\nPCB: 2-layer 1.6 mm, 2 oz. F.Cu solid zone = DC_BUS_P (front, P busbar plate side); B.Cu solid zone = DC_BUS_N (back, N plate side).\nZone connections SOLID (no thermal reliefs) for ripple current. Netclass clearance 2.0 mm (SPEC 10, 450 V functional).\nM6 lugs: J1-J3 -> module P1/P2/P3, J5-J7 -> module N1/N2/N3 (47 mm phase pitch, positions per busbar drawing [TBV]);\nJ4/J8 -> battery/busbar feed at far short edge. J9/J10: low-current sense taps to control board (divider, bleeder, flyback, precharge)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 152.4 0)
		(effects
